# skills + manual-targeting: a picked back-row enemy that moves to the front row before the caster acts
# keeps the pick. Jian (level index 8) and Lucia, first temple battle: back row 4, 5, 6, front row 9, 10.
# Jian casts Weapon Break on back-row battler 5 (grid: Right, A); Lucia Fights front-row battler 9, the
# enemy in front of it, and kills it first; battler 5 drops into slot 9 (battler and stat record are
# copied). Expect the ATK stage of record 9 (the moved enemy) to go 0 -> -1 (0xFFFF) and no other stage to
# change. Battle records at 0x0228E860 (peeked below), 0x6C each, ATK stage +0x40. Run with --save.
include party2_strong
pin u32 0x020B4664 8
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
watch u16 0x0228EA50 stage4
watch u16 0x0228EABC stage5
watch u16 0x0228EB28 stage6
watch u16 0x0228EC00 stage8
watch u16 0x0228EC6C stage9
watch u16 0x0228ECD8 stage10
watch u32 0x0228EC40 hp9
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 70
press Right 8
wait 20
shot mt_jian_pick
press A 8
wait 60
shot mt_lucia_cmd
press A 8
wait 60
shot mt_lucia_pick
press A 8
wait 60
shot mt_after_pick
wait 240
shot mt_round_a
wait 240
shot mt_round_b
battlers
